00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-Great show tonight.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:01.935 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:04.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
Paul Giamatti is here tonight,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:04.938 --> 00:00:06.072 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Paul Giamatti.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.040 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
Common is here tonight.
We have Common.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.611 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:12.379 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And we've got magic

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:16.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
from "America's Got Talent"
winner, Shin Lim.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:16.716 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yeah.

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.318 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:20.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, and after yesterday's
Senate hearing,

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.056 align:start size:94% position:6%
hopefully he can make everyone
in Washington disappear.

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:24.090 size:88% position:44% line:92%
That would be fantastic.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:24.791 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:27.761
Speaking of leaving Washington,
I saw that next week,

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:30.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
First Lady Melania Trump
is going to Africa

00:00:30.497 --> 00:00:31.731 size:88% position:44% line:92%
on a humanitarian visit.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.834
When she gets there, people will
be like, "How can we help you?"

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.870 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:40.340
But I heard that Africa will be
Melania's first big solo trip

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.041 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
as First Lady.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
In response, Donald was like,
"I love 'Africa.'

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.178 line:92%
It's my favorite song by Toto."

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:46.946 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"I bless the rains.

00:00:48.948 --> 00:00:51.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
I bless the rains
down in Africa."

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
Speaking of the president,
he just wrapped up

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:54.587 line:92%
his week here in New York

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
after coming to town
for the U.N.

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can tell he really enjoyed
being back in the city.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:01.327 align:start size:94% position:6%
In fact, check out
this video he released.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:03.396 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.698 line:92%
-Start spreading the fake news.

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:07.967 size:84% position:42% line:92%
It's fake. Phony. Fake.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:10.136 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm leaving today.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.671 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Today.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:15.375 line:92%
I don't want to be a part of it.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:18.278
I'm leaving now,
and I'm getting out of New York.

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm getting the hell
out of here now!

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:24.484 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.853 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Go back!

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.254 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Some TV news.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.189 line:92%
I saw that for the first time,

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:32.892
Canadians are now eligible
to compete on "Survivor."

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:34.127 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:01:34.127 --> 00:01:35.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
Which will be great until
they all

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:36.796 line:92%
politely vote themselves off.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:38.264 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Like, "Sorry, sorry."

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:40.600
Hey, guys, listen to this.
You probably haven't heard this.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:43.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
Alaska Airlines
might start giving out

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:46.606
virtual reality headsets
to first class passengers.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:47.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:48.608 line:92%
Meanwhile, if you're in coach,

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:51.744
they just duct tape an in-flight
magazine to your forehead.

00:01:51.744 --> 00:01:52.846 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's still fun.

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:56.015 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]
"It's like I'm there!"

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:56.816 size:75% position:38% line:92%
This is interesting.

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:59.919
I heard that IHOP is now making
their own beer.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:00.687 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:02:00.687 --> 00:02:03.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's perfect for people
who think Waffle House beer

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:04.824 line:92%
is just a little too trashy.

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:06.359 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:08.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
I read that Taco Bell's
breakfast menu

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
is pretty popular,

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
but nobody is ordering
their coffee.

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:15.168
Probably because drinking coffee
after eating Taco Bell is...

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:17.637 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:20.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like dropping a pack
of Mentos into some Diet Coke.

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:22.675 line:92%
You know what I'm saying?

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.544 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Whoa!

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:25.345 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:25.345 --> 00:02:29.415
-And Dunkin' Donuts is changing
their name to just Dunkin'.

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:30.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
This has
some loyal customers nervous

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.952 align:start size:94% position:6%
about what else
is changing about the stores,

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.888 size:81% position:41%
so we thought we'd put
people's minds at ease

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:36.222 line:92%
and let you know all the things

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:38.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
that are not changing
at Dunkin'.

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.893 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
For instance...

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.865 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Next up...

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:52.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
And finally...

00:02:57.243 --> 00:03:01.915 align:start size:94% position:6%
New name.
Same old Dunkin'.

00:03:01.915 --> 00:03:02.582 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You see this?

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:06.486 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can now take
at-home STD tests.

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:07.921 align:start size:94% position:6%
Health care experts say
it's perfect

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:11.324
