00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:20.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the makers
of hand dryers said,

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:23.002 align:start size:94% position:6%
"But don't forget,
we also don't dry your hands."

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:25.505 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:29.909
But the news is so crazy lately,
sometimes it feels like

00:03:29.909 --> 00:03:30.810 line:92%
