than the actual news.

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:41.888
Here's the first example.
If you blend the stories...

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:50.430 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You get...

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:55.034 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:57.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
Next up, if you blend
the stories...

00:04:04.277 --> 00:04:05.712 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You get...

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:09.782 line:92%
A little bit better than...

00:04:09.782 --> 00:04:12.885
-[ As Dr. Phil ]
How's that working out for you?

00:04:12.885 --> 00:04:15.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Next up,
if you blend the stories...

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:23.096 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You get...

00:04:25.164 --> 00:04:26.499 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:28.601 line:92%
And here's the last one here.

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:30.803 line:92%
If you blend the stories...

00:04:37.543 --> 00:04:39.012 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You get...

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:41.381 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey!

00:04:41.381 --> 00:04:44.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's not much crazier
than the actual news.

